        </imixs:item>
        <imixs:item name="rtfmailbody" type="xs:string">
          <imixs:value><![CDATA[
Hallo,

thanks for contacting us. Ee went through your data carefully. Your VAT ID provided is not valid. Can you please verify and provide us valid VAT Id to further process your request. 

Looking forward to listen from you.]]></imixs:value>
        </imixs:item>
      </bpmn2:extensionElements>
